{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538210/extras/bc22bc753bbb761c8bfa2d306a739c9e.avif?t=1773847295\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538210/extras_big/bc22bc753bbb761c8bfa2d306a739c9e.avif?t=1773847295 width=800 height=362 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of the Alliance's most advanced starfighter in a thrilling story-driven campaign.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced first-person combat, with full control over your ship's power and shield distribution.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear, diegetic UI provides critical information at a glance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight alongside an elite squad of quirky alien teammates. Then relax in the ship's bar.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built for both VR and traditional monitors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full support for HOTAS joysticks, gamepads, VR motion controllers and mouse/keyboard.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full Steam Deck compatibility.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OpenTrack support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Alliance Peacefighter is a tribute to the golden age of space sims, and a love letter to the people who grew up with them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538210/extras/faba2fa4297150a9c3c2bfc147067a53.avif?t=1773847295\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538210/extras_big/faba2fa4297150a9c3c2bfc147067a53.avif?t=1773847295 width=800 hei